    "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:14:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-24T15:02:18Z",
    "body": "I have an experimental solution for this in Gecko [Bug 2001975 - Navigation API navigations and regular navigations don't share timing](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2001975). I'm going to see if this can be converted to spec. Basically the idea is to introduce an inner method tracker for the non-Navigation API cases.",
