    "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:58:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-25T08:58:07Z",
    "body": "@noamr: I've pushed a PR that fixes this. It works in Gecko, and I think it should work in Blink as well, even in the case where Blink doesn't implement spec and uses `Promise.all`. The commited promise in the now always present method tracker should resolve on the same timing regardless.",
