    "created_at": "2026-03-02T15:54:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-02T15:54:04Z",
    "body": "Ok, so the wider issue is the following: [#commit-a-navigate-event](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#commit-a-navigate-event) falls through to call the intercept handlers, even in the case of calling [#resume-applying-the-traverse-history-step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#resume-applying-the-traverse-history-step).\n\nI'll file a new issue about this, so that we can reboot the conversation now that I think I actually have the root cause.",
